+// D3D12 backend for Arm Accuracy Super Resolution's ffxm interface.
+//
+// Copyright (c) 2023 Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.
+// Copyright (c) 2024-2025 Arm Limited.
+// Copyright (c) 2026 the OptiScaler ARM64EC port contributors.
